# Cursor local workspace state.
# Keep .cursor/rules, .cursor/skills, and .cursor/*.md project docs tracked.
.cursor/index/
.cursor/cache/
.cursor/logs/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
